  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda - Connecting small holders to Specialty Robusta Markets</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brand Development Group BV is a social enterprise that has been investing for several years in setting up a commercial Specialty Robusta Coffee demonstration farm in Uganda, Brand Coffee Farm Uganda. The company aims to develop robusta coffee as a specialty coffee in production areas where robusta is sold exclusively by farmers as a commodity product at a low price.With a DGGF subsidy impact of the existing loan will be amplified. During the project 950 smallholder farmers will be connected to the processing and exporting process of Brand Coffee Farm. esult from the project will be  that the farmers on the one hand receive a higher price for their coffee and on the other hand can produce larger volumes and realize additional income from macadamia, vanilla and honey. Setting up a youth start-up will involve more women in the coffee sector and provide farmers with support. The focus on regenerative agroforestry and circular coffee farming will contribute to improving climate change, adaptation and mitigation, in addition to improving biodiversity.</narrative>
  </description>
